  partName: Blade18
  description: The Blade18 is a tiny, thin-flat blade positioned at the middle-center-front
    of the jet engine, contributing to the compression and acceleration of air. Fabricated
    from Blades2 material, its compact size and thin-flat shape facilitate smooth
    airflow and minimize energy losses. Interestingly, the Blade18's material properties
    enable it to maintain its structural integrity under high-stress conditions.
